OL,3,ABrand moved from Wandsworth to category
OL,4,AC prison, his wife confirms on podcast
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand has been transferred to a
OL,7,Fcategory C prison, his wife Laura has
OL,8,Fconfirmed, in her first public comments
OL,9,Fsince his jailing.
OL,11,FOn Monday, the comedian was sentenced
OL,12,Fto 10-and-a-half years in prison after
OL,13,Fbeing convicted of one count of rape
OL,14,Fand three counts of sexual assault.
OL,16,FOver the weekend, Brand was transferred
OL,17,Ffrom category B HMP Wandsworth in
OL,18,FLondon to HMP Littlehey in
OL,19,FCambridgeshire, which houses men
OL,20,Fconvicted of sexual offences.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
